[{"id":"e10-one-intervention-not-causal","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 质量工程","tags":["Agent 质量工程","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(十)Trace与归因.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(十)Trace与归因","articlePath":"posts/3fd443e5/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(十)Trace与归因.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(十)Trace与归因","articlePath":"posts/3fd443e5/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“归因边界”的课程边界中，为什么“一次干预”不是“因果”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>一次干预只提供父子关系；因果还需要在first上由对照结果确认，不能只看文本或单个事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在trace夹具中分别运行“一次干预”和“因果”，比较模型、Prompt、Context、Tool与首个偏差；Trace 是定位材料，不是业务 Oracle；输出正确仍要查副作用。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"g02-generation-vs-runner","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"AI 辅助测试","tags":["AI 辅助测试","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/ai-assisted-testing/AI 辅助测试(二)协作边界.md","articleTitle":"AI 辅助测试(二)协作边界","articlePath":"posts/41bcbe17/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/ai-assisted-testing/AI 辅助测试(二)协作边界.md","articleTitle":"AI 辅助测试(二)协作边界","articlePath":"posts/41bcbe17/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“验收责任”的课程边界中，生成与运行器如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先把生成的控制变量设为role，把运行器的对照变量设为contract；在相同样本上分别记录可追溯，再按失败边界作出选择。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>比较生成与运行器时，不共享缓存或副作用；保存输入、状态转移和独立 Oracle。生成失败或模型不可用时，执行器仍应能运行已确认资产；业务验收不能自动跳过。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-fixture-scope","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["pytest","Fixture"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十五)自动化框架与交付.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十五)自动化框架与交付","articlePath":"posts/bdd9d1a1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十五)自动化框架与交付.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十五)自动化框架与交付","articlePath":"posts/bdd9d1a1/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Appium 的 driver Fixture 为什么通常从 function 作用域开始？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>每条用例独立建立和关闭会话，可以隔离页面、权限、账号和数据状态，让失败起点更可解释。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Fixture 是测试框架负责准备资源、在用例结束后清理资源的函数。\u003ccode>function\u003c/code> 作用域表示每条用例都新建并关闭一次 driver session；\u003ccode>session\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>module\u003c/code> 作用域可以更快，但会共享页面、权限、账号或数据状态，需要证明清理完整且用例顺序不会影响结果。移动端状态复杂时先使用 function 作用域，等证据证明共享安全后再优化，并把设备与账号资源分配显式化。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a12-storage-danger","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["存储","风险"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/9efa11cb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/9efa11cb/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 mkfs、wipefs、fsck 不能直接在生产设备上练习？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它们可能重写文件系统元数据或改变设备状态，错误目标会造成不可逆数据损失。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这些命令直接作用于文件系统元数据或设备状态：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>命令\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>可能改变什么\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>可接受的练习对象\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>mkfs\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>重建文件系统元数据\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>新建的 loopback 镜像\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>wipefs\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>清除签名\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可丢弃的实验镜像\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>fsck\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>修复文件系统结构\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>卸载后的测试副本\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>先创建镜像、保存快照、验证恢复介质，再在隔离对象上演练；设备路径必须人工二次确认。生产盘上的一次误选可能让备份也来不及使用。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-13-backup-vs-replication-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["备份","复制","PITR","GTID"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十三)备份恢复与复制.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十三)备份恢复与复制","articlePath":"posts/94d5d11f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十三)备份恢复与复制.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十三)备份恢复与复制","articlePath":"posts/94d5d11f/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 replica 不能替代备份？RecoverLab 的时间点恢复最小闭环是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 1. 生成并校验一致基线\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">mysqldump --single-transaction --source-data=2 --databases shoplab &gt; shoplab-baseline.sql\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">sha256sum\u003c/span> shoplab-baseline.sql\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 2. 在隔离实例重载，再审阅并重放基线之后的 binlog；dump 自带 shoplab 上下文\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">mysql --binary-mode=1 &lt; shoplab-baseline.sql\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">mysqlbinlog --stop-datetime=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-08-26 10:15:00&#x27;\u003c/span> binlog.000123 &gt; replay.sql\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">mysql --binary-mode=1 &lt; replay.sql\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">COUNT\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"operator\">*\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> users \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> users;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">COUNT\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"operator\">*\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">SUM\u003c/span>(total_amount) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> paid_sales \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;paid&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>副本解决的是可用性和读取扩展，误删、错误 \u003ccode>UPDATE\u003c/code> 也会被复制过去；PITR 则需要一条独立恢复链：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">一致基线 + SHA-256\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        ↓\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">连续保留的 binlog\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        ↓ 选定时间/位点\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">隔离实例重放\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        ↓\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">业务验收（行数、金额、引用完整性）\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>RecoverLab 的固定验收值是 \u003ccode>users=4\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>orders=5\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>paid_sales=2575.00\u003c/code>，还要检查断裂明细为 0。复制线程 \u003ccode>RUNNING\u003c/code> 或 dump 文件存在都不是恢复证明；示例时间、文件名和位点只用于演练，生产必须由实际保留策略和授权窗口确定。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a04-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["需求分析","预期"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(四)需求分析与静态评审.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(四)需求分析与静态评审","articlePath":"posts/f6e019d6/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(四)需求分析与静态评审.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(四)需求分析与静态评审","articlePath":"posts/f6e019d6/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>需求没写清时，测试者能否自己定一个预期？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>可以提出并标明假设来继续分析，但产品预期应由相关责任人确认；未确认的假设不能直接作为判缺陷的唯一依据。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>“会员最多借三本”没有说明逾期未还是否计数。测试者若自行排除逾期，再把系统拒绝借阅判为缺陷，就把自己的猜测变成了产品约束。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>处理步骤\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>借阅例子\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>记录歧义\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前三册中一册逾期，是否还能再借？\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>提出候选与影响\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>若计入应拒绝；若排除可能允许，库存与提示预期也随之不同\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>取得决定\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>业务负责人确认计入，并更新规则版本\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>固化验收例子\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>三册含逾期时仍拒绝，状态不变\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>在决定之前可以分别分析两种假设，但报告需标明规则未定。已有合同或其他明确依据时，也应记录该依据，不能只依赖个人直觉。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]